---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { GLOBAL } from "../lib/config";
const started = new Date("2016-07-01T00:00:00Z");
const years = Math.max(1, Math.floor((Date.now() - started.getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24 * 365)));
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Full-Stack Engineer with 8+ years experience building enterprise applications using Java,Srpingboot and React. Currently at Cognizant in Chennai, India."
  keywords="Kirupakaran V, Full Stack Engineer, Java Developer, Springboot Developer, Vue.js, React, Software Engineer Chennai, Web Developer India, Backend Developer, Frontend Developer"
>
  <section class="w-full py-10 space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-wider mb-4">About Me</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl xq-accent-muted leading-relaxed">
        Full-Stack Engineer building reliable, enterprise web applications
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none space-y-6">
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        I'm Kirupakaran V, a passionate full-stack engineer with {years} years of experience crafting
        digital solutions from Chennai, India. I specialize in building reliable, fast, and maintainable
        web applications that solve real-world problems.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        My expertise spans across backend development with <strong>Java</strong> and <strong>Springboot</strong>,
        frontend frameworks like <strong>Vue</strong> and <strong>React</strong>, and modern tooling including
        <strong>Astro</strong> and <strong>Tailwind CSS</strong>. I believe in writing clean, well-tested code
        and creating exceptional developer experiences.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Currently, I work as a Full Stack Engineer at Cognizant, where I build enterprise tools and
        services that power innovative AI solutions. Previously, I spent over 3 years at HCL,
        designing and shipping banking production systems.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        When I'm not coding, you'll find me contributing to open source projects, exploring new technologies,
        or sharing knowledge through my personal projects. I'm particularly interested in developer experience,
        performance optimization, and turning complex problems into elegant solutions.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 p-6 border xq-border rounded-lg bg-gray-50/50 dark:bg-gray-900/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 xq-accent">Quick Facts</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base">
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> Chennai, India</li>
          <li><strong>Experience:</strong> {years} years in software development</li>
          <li><strong>Education:</strong> B.tech. Informtion Technology, Tamilnadu College of Engineering</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
